{"resourceIdentifier":"3696","resourceName":"Chongqing Tongliang LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Chongqing Tongliang LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at the Tongliang Municipal Solid Waste Landfill, Wanshou Village, Taiping Town, Tongliang District, Chongqing City, China. The purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system, flaring and electricity generation system. LFG collected is used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity is 2.134 MW including 2 generators with 1.067 MW each. \r\nIn absence of the project, equivalent amount of electricity exported to the grid by the project would have otherwise been supplied by Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":29.932680,"longitude":106.039697},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-09-23","endExclusive":"2022-10-24","endInclusive":"2022-10-23"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3696"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chongqing"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chongqing Tongliang Zhonglanhuanneng Environmental Technology Co. Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Sichuan, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3696"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"50729"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"02/03/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2021 - 31/12/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=73733&IDKEY=0iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfk101677807","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Tongliang_VCS PD_V01.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-09-07T06:55:33.12Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=73623&IDKEY=kq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha101526117","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Tongliang_Verra-Listing-Representation-Single Representator.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-09-05T09:40:20.75Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85728&IDKEY=f0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9i118218912","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Tongliang_VCSPD&MR-20210101-20220731-V03-clean.pdf.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-02T15:02:45.5Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81486&IDKEY=kkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9090112369194","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"08-Tongliang_VCS Registration Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-12-23T05:24:03.343Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85731&IDKEY=siofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3d118223049","documentType":"Validati